:italic&quot;&gt;«enumeration»&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;OperacionBitacora" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=#4B53A8;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2B338C;strokeWidth=1.4;startSize=42;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;swimlaneLine=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="770" width="160" height="284" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:18px;&quot;&gt;CREAR&lt;br&gt;ACTUALIZAR&lt;br&gt;ELIMINAR&lt;br&gt;INACTIVAR&lt;br&gt;CERRAR&lt;br&gt;REABRIR&lt;br&gt;ACCESO_DENEGADO&lt;br&gt;INICIO_SESION&lt;br&gt;GENERAR_CONJUNTO&lt;br&gt;ENTRENAR&lt;br&gt;ACTIVAR&lt;br&gt;REVERTIR&lt;br&gt;CONFIGURAR&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=9;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=-0.5;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111827;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="c32"><mxGeometry x="0" y="42" width="160" height="242" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:16px;&quot;&gt;Las entidades de negocio de todos los&lt;br&gt;paquetes heredan de EntidadAuditable&lt;br&gt;(id y datos de auditoría). Bitacora y los&lt;br&gt;registros de uso de la IA no heredan:&lt;br&gt;solo admiten inserción (RNF-004).&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=12;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=1.84;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#78350F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="30" width="340" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:16px;&quot;&gt;USUARIO y ROL se guardan como texto para&lt;br&gt;que el registro no cambie si después se&lt;br&gt;modifica el usuario. La base de datos solo&lt;br&gt;permite INSERT en BITACORA; si la escritura&lt;br&gt;falla, la transacción completa se revierte.&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;size=12;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=1.84;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#78350F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="600" y="800" width="340" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2B338C;strokeWidth=1.3;endArrow=block;endFill=0;endSize=14;startArrow=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="100" y="290" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="414.5" y="204" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="100" y="250"/><mxPoint x="414.5" y="250"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2B338C;strokeWidth=1.3;endArrow=block;endFill=0;endSize=14;startArrow=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c6" target="c2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="377" y="290" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="414.5" y="204" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="377" y="250"/><mxPoint x="414.5" y="250"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2B338C;strokeWidth=1.3;endArrow=block;endFill=0;endSize=14;startArrow=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111827;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exi